  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe given expression is (√768 × √3267)/√144\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nPrime factors of 768 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 3\n\n∴ √768 = 16√3\n\nPrime factors of 3267 = 3 × 3 × 3 × 11 × 11\n\n∴ √3267 = 33√3\n\nPrime factors of 144 = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 3 × 3\n\n∴ √144 = 12\n\nThen, (√768 × √3267)/√144\n\n= (16√3 × 33√3)/12\n\n= 1584/12\n\n= 132\n\n**∴ The value of (√768 × √3267)/√144 is 132.**",
